      "zh": "第一性原理：除動態調整本質 Outcome 外，必須把已嚴重偏離目標的工作／程式提出並去除（code diet）。每次更動批次審查 diverge → prune 或 justify，禁止以新碼掩蓋偏離。",
      "en": "First principles: besides dynamically adjusting the essential Outcome, surface and remove severely goal-divergent work/code (diet). Every change batch must review diverge candidates → prune or justify; never layer new code over drift.",
